#eeeeee;border-bottom-style:solid;border-left-color:#eeeeee;border-left-style:solid;}.kt-accordion-id1846_2d4879-6d .kt-accordion-header-wrap .kt-blocks-accordion-header:focus-visible, .kt-accordion-id1846_2d4879-6d .kt-accordion-header-wrap .kt-blocks-accordion-header.kt-accordion-panel-active{border-top-color:#ffffff;border-top-style:solid;border-right-color:#ffffff;border-right-style:solid;border-bottom-color:#ffffff;border-bottom-style:solid;border-left-color:#ffffff;border-left-style:solid;}}<\/style>\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-accordion alignnone\"><div class=\"kt-accordion-wrap kt-accordion-id1846_2d4879-6d kt-accordion-has-20-panes kt-active-pane-0 kt-accordion-block kt-pane-header-alignment-left kt-accodion-icon-style-basic kt-accodion-icon-side-right\" style=\"max-width:none\"><div class=\"kt-accordion-inner-wrap\" data-allow-multiple-open=\"false\" data-start-open=\"none\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-pane kt-accordion-pane kt-accordion-pane-12 kt-pane1846_053968-36\"><h3 class=\"kt-accordion-header-wrap\"><button class=\"kt-blocks-accordion-header kt-acccordion-button-label-show\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"kt-blocks-accordion-title-wrap\"><span class=\"kt-blocks-accordion-title\">Junior Python Developer \u2013 Automation &amp; Internal Tools<\/span><\/span><span class=\"kt-blocks-accordion-icon-trigger\"><\/span><\/button><\/h3><div class=\"kt-accordion-panel kt-accordion-panel-hidden\"><div class=\"kt-accordion-panel-inner\">\n<p><strong>Functional Title:<\/strong> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Junior Python Developer \u2013 Automation &amp; Internal Tools<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Corporate Title: &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <\/strong>Associate&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Location<\/strong>:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Orinda, CA&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Compensation:<\/strong>  Base salary of $70,000 &#8211; $85,000 (based on experience) +<br>eligibility for a Discretionary Bonus<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Technical Requirements<\/strong><br><strong>Current Tech Stack &amp; Tools in Use<\/strong><br><strong>Languages &amp; Frameworks<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Python \u2013 Primary language for automation, data processing, and internal tools<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>VBA \u2013 Used for maintaining and modernizing legacy systems<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>React, Django, Flask \u2013 Full-stack web frameworks<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Libraries &amp; Tools<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Pandas \u2013 Data transformation and Excel integration<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>OpenPyXL \/ XlsxWriter \u2013 Excel automation<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Tkinter \/ CustomTkinter \u2013 GUI applications<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Selenium \u2013 Web scraping and automation<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Regex \u2013 Complex string parsing<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>SQL (SQLite) \u2013 Lightweight storage for internal tools and dashboards<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>XML \/ ElementTree \u2013 Config and log handling<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Outlook Automation (win32com) \u2013 Compliance and exception reporting<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>PowerShell \/ Batch \/ WinSCP \u2013 Scripting and file transfer<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Bloomberg API (blpapi) \u2013 Financial data access<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>AI Model Integration (e.g., ChatGPT API) \u2013 Intelligent parsing and assistance<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Project Areas<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Financial data parsing and validation<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Automation and internal tooling<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Web scraping \/ RPA<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>DevOps scripting and process automation<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Ideal Junior Developer Skill Profile<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Proficiency with Python and VBA (1 to 2 years\u2019 experience)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Experience with Pandas and Excel-based workflows<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Familiarity with GUI frameworks such as Tkinter or Streamlit<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Exposure to Selenium, regex, and REST APIs<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Comfort with scripting, command line, and basic DevOps workflows<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Interest in working with legacy systems; VBA experience is a strong plus<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Bonus: Background in finance or market concepts (options, CUSIPs, delta, etc.)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Essential Qualifications<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Bachelor&#8217;s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a quantitative field<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Ability to present technical information to non-technical audiences<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Proficient in relational database design and querying<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Strong programming skills, especially in Python, with working knowledge of at least one other language (e.g., VBA, R, C#, JavaScript, SQL)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Understanding of financial markets and the operational needs of an investment firm<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Ability to integrate programming with Microsoft Office, DevOps tools, and database management<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Experience with full-stack development and building tools for non-technical users<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Familiarity with IT security practices, including securing databases and websites<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Experience working with Microsoft Azure and Active Directory<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Core Responsibilities<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Design and develop reporting tools that integrate with Microsoft Office<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Build intuitive automation scripts and user interfaces for business users<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Work independently while collaborating effectively with cross-functional teams<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Help modernize and maintain legacy systems, rewriting critical code when needed<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Support internal automation efforts across data parsing, reporting, and compliance workflows<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Write technical documentation and research relevant industry best practices<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Location &amp; Hours:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Orinda, CA (San Francisco Bay Area)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>7:30 am to 3:00pm PT<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-pane kt-accordion-pane kt-accordion-pane-20 kt-pane1846_123506-1e\"><h3 class=\"kt-accordion-header-wrap\"><button class=\"kt-blocks-accordion-header kt-acccordion-button-label-show\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"kt-blocks-accordion-title-wrap\"><span class=\"kt-blocks-accordion-title\">Fixed Income Salesperson<\/span><\/span><span class=\"kt-blocks-accordion-icon-trigger\"><\/span><\/button><\/h3><div class=\"kt-accordion-panel kt-accordion-panel-hidden\"><div class=\"kt-accordion-panel-inner\">\n<p><strong>Functional Title:<\/strong> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Fixed Income Salesperson<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Corporate Title: &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <\/strong>Vice President (or higher)<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Assignment<\/strong>: &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Full Time (Permanent) &nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Location<\/strong>:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Chicago, IL \/ New York, NY \/ San Francisco Bay Area, CA&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Position Summary:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The Fixed Income Group\u2019s current business includes corporate bonds (secondary and new issue placement), Money Markets, CP\/DN\u2019s Agency securities (secondary and underwritten as FHLB an.d FNMA approved dealer), MBS, CMBS (agency and private label), Municipal (secondary trading), High Yield and Emerging Market. <em><u>Individual and team applications welcome.<\/u><\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Essential Duties and Responsibilities<\/strong>:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Strengthen existing relationships while maximizing revenue.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Create new client relationships.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Effectively use tools such as Bloomberg for analytics, research and communication.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Keep market-making traders abreast of the relevant issues with their clients.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Responsible for executing trading assignments and single security orders in accordance with agreed upon instructions from the firm.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Ability to create, maintain and unwind various hedging strategies using multiple methods alongside program trading assignments.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Take ownership for regional best execution responsibilities and ongoing counterparty execution quality and analysis.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Understand, comply and implement necessary regulatory responsibilities for portfolio execution.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Send trade confirms and assist with trade settlement for account.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Work with trading and compliance to create and maintain procedures and documentation for operations best practices.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><a><strong>Requirements:<\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Schedule\/Location:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Chicago, IL<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>New York, NY<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Orinda, CA<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Required Education:<\/strong>&nbsp; An associate or undergraduate bachelor\u2019s degree in Business, Finance, Economics or related discipline with a strong academic record.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Compensation\/Benefits:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Compensation &#8211; Commission only<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Medical\/dental\/vision\/life benefits<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>401k with matching<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Required Licenses or Certifications:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Series 7<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Series 63<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:42px\" aria-